{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11112150","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11112150","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1111215001:1":{"text":"리아, 카이가 돌아오면 내가 떠났다고 전해줘.","source_cn":"小狸亚，如果你看到卡卡回来，记得告诉她我走了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x37E3415F7FCB2245","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1111215002:0":{"text":"그, 그럼 우리 이제 다시 못 만나...?","source_cn":"那，我们以后还能见到你吗……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3E8DCF259406A3E2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1111215003:1":{"text":"너희가 평온한 일상을 되찾기 전까진 계속 만나게 될 거야.","source_cn":"在你们的生活回归平静之前，我们还会再见的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x90122931D5F1A0C1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1111215004:1":{"text":"내가 떠나도 여기 삼촌들이 지켜줄 거고.","source_cn":"我走后，还有这些叔叔继续保护你们。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6DD7F7A186DCEFA0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1111215005:1":{"text":"현상금 사냥꾼을 믿을 수 있어?","source_cn":"赏金猎人可靠吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8379BA2DFCF46F3B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1111215006:1":{"text":"다른 현상금 사냥꾼은 못 믿어도 저들은 달라. 평판을 중요하게 여기거든.","source_cn":"或许其他的赏金猎人不算可靠，但他们不一样。他们很注重名声。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x59065B0C0C8A8CBA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1111215007:1":{"text":"저 사람들이 예전에 모래 폭풍에 빠져서 길을 잃고 굶어 죽을 뻔했을 때 내가 구해준 적이 있는데,","source_cn":"此前，这些人在沙暴中迷失了方位，差点因为饥渴失去性命，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x19E293A378CD5613","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1111215008:1":{"text":"목숨을 구해준 것에 대한 보답으로 아이들을 지켜주는 거기도 해.","source_cn":"算是为了还我的救命之恩，他们答应保护这些孩子。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAFCE850F1E31D4F2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1111215009:1":{"text":"의리는 있네.","source_cn":"还算有情有义。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCED92FF1515381B7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1111215010:0":{"text":"안탄드라 언니, 카이에게 메시지 전해줄게. 그리고 조심해... 우리 모두 언니가 다치는 건 바라지 않아.","source_cn":"安丹姐姐，我会转告卡卡的。你要小心啊……我们都不希望安...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8C4AA721C068B14D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1111215011:1":{"text":"응. 금방 돌아올게.","sourc